---
import { url } from '../lib/url'
---
<section
  class="relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-cream dark:bg-ink-900"
>
  <!-- Animated blueprint grid that drifts, warps toward a central "eye", and breaks. -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-blueprint opacity-[0.35] dark:opacity-20 animate-grid-drift"></div>
    <svg class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
      <defs>
        <radialGradient id="panopticon-eye" cx="50%" cy="42%" r="55%">
          <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#C05640" stop-opacity="0.22" />
          <stop offset="35%" stop-color="#C05640" stop-opacity="0.05" />
          <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#C05640" stop-opacity="0" />
        </radialGradient>
      </defs>
      <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#panopticon-eye)" />
      <!-- radial "surveillance" sightlines -->
      <g stroke="#1A202C" stroke-opacity="0.08" class="dark:opacity-40">
        <line x1="50%" y1="42%" x2="0" y2="0" />
        <line x1="50%" y1="42%" x2="100%" y2="0" />
        <line x1="50%" y1="42%" x2="0" y2="100%" />
        <line x1="50%" y1="42%" x2="100%" y2="100%" />
        <line x1="50%" y1="42%" x2="50%" y2="0" />
        <line x1="50%" y1="42%" x2="50%" y2="100%" />
        <line x1="50%" y1="42%" x2="0" y2="50%" />
        <line x1="50%" y1="42%" x2="100%" y2="50%" />
      </g>
      <circle cx="50%" cy="42%" r="3" fill="#C05640" />
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 text-center">
    <div class="mb-6 inline-block animate-fade-in">
      <span class="font-mono text-rust uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sm border border-rust px-3 py-1"
        >Research Document · 2026</span
      >
    </div>
    <h1
      class="font-display font-extrabold text-5xl md:text-7xl lg:text-8xl mb-6 tracking-tighter leading-[0.9] animate-slide-up"
    >
      THE ARCHITECTURE<br />OF AMBITION
    </h1>
    <p
      class="font-body text-xl md:text-2xl text-surveillance/70 dark:text-cream/70 max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-10 animate-slide-up"
      style="animation-delay: 0.2s;"
    >
      How career became identity, why it’s breaking us, and the structural flaws in the “rational”
      pursuit of success.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4 animate-slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.4s;">
      <a
        href={url('system')}
        class="px-8 py-4 bg-surveillance text-cream dark:bg-rust font-mono uppercase tracking-widest hover:bg-rust dark:hover:bg-surveillance transition-colors"
        >Enter the System</a
      >
      <a
        href={url('diagnostic')}
        class="px-8 py-4 border border-surveillance/30 dark:border-cream/30 font-mono uppercase tracking-widest hover:border-rust hover:text-rust transition-colors"
        >Take the Diagnostic</a
      >
    </div>
    <div class="mt-12 animate-slide-up" style="animation-delay: 0.6s">
      <button
        onclick="document.getElementById('chapters').scrollIntoView({behavior:'smooth'})"
        aria-label="Scroll to chapters"
        class="flex flex-col items-center gap-1 text-surveillance/60 dark:text-cream/60 hover:text-rust transition-colors mx-auto"
      >
        <span class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest">The Seven Chapters</span>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-3xl" aria-hidden="true">expand_more</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
